  "rationale": "The batch repeatedly uses noun phrases after determiners and adjectives, but several noun roots provide little general support for those contexts; the representative prefix “The” assigns most mass to competing nouns instead of the observed noun. Add moderate, POS-based noun evidence after a terminal determiner or adjective for frequent batch nouns, preserving lexical alternatives. The batch also repeatedly contains the closing phrase “for now” and the constructions “That/This is”; their target roots have negligible baseline mass, so add narrow lexical-context rules. The preceding candidate improved current-batch loss, with replay loss within the stated tolerance, but that does not establish that this provisional patch will pass the gate. These patterns may also boost nouns or verbs in contexts where other continuations are valid, so the added weights are deliberately limited.",
